From 15f1a4d7bd33670fd3b0a85af639111510933291 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 13:15:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] test(claude-eval): G262-9 replay state limits of alias
 receipts

Huge integers in epoch_window gave a raw OverflowError; a string passed as
seen_switch_ids became a set of characters and silently disabled replay
detection; None and invalid ids were accepted. All now give stable codes.
Pure validation stays file-free; a separate experimental store consumes
ids durably with O_EXCL + fsync (12 concurrent processes: exactly one wins).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Rv89UzspoLREq2u9UkZssh
